+*   **Write Collisions**: Simultaneous writes by multiple child processes to the Bop format cause collisions [S1, unofficial]. This is handled by semaphores that enforce mutual exclusion [S1, unofficial].
 *   **Memory Constraint**: Requires at least two slices to fit into physical memory [S1, unofficial].
 
